    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Earrorim is centered at 35.304809, -101.696678 under Federal Republic, with 67,529,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Earrorim occupies 6,220,096.85 sq mi / 16,109,976.88 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.158411% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Beach and grass with water, Partial forest and Beach and reefs with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Partial forest, Farming and Beach and reefs with water. Population density is 4.192 people/sq km / 10.857 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Fey and Trickster Folk, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Wood Elf, Harengon, Elf — Eladrin, Fey-Folk — Faerie, Satyr, Changeling, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Regent Lattice, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Sigrananna, Iskareth, Raeshkul, Bastveig, Thalunesh, and 3 more.",
      "groupLinkDescription": "The province participates in 8 recorded four-province geography group links, including 6 cross-transportation-group links. These links place it inside overlapping regional corridors rather than one isolated block, allowing border-adjacent transit, faction influence, and cultural spillover to breathe across group lines.",
